# Canonical app icon assets are committed so CI packaging (electron-builder)
# always embeds the real icon instead of falling back to the default Electron
# one. Regenerate with `npm run icons` if the artwork changes.
!build/icon.ico
!build/icon.png
!build/icon-tray.png
